        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cogen unit 50kWe, common components for heat+electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cogen unit 50kWe, common components for heat+electricity
The module summarises infrastructure components of a cogeneration unit. ;
UUID: 0c348eb2-ab93-3abf-9a53-8641ef6bb1a4
The module includes all shared components for heat and electricity production.
Location: Extrapolated from data of a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER).
Technology: Extrapolated from data of a 160kWe lambda=1 plant, adjusted to lean burn technology currently available on market, no catalytic converters.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0c348eb2-ab93-3abf-9a53-8641ef6bb1a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
